{
  "key": 1030,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FlowerShop_Text_BerryWillGrowIntoPlant",
      "en_US": [
        "A single Berry will grow into a plant\n",
        "that makes several Berries.\r",
        "By planting one, there will be more\n",
        "and more Berries in the world.\r",
        "I hope you will help us spread more\n",
        "Berries everywhere!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Une seule Baie suffit pour faire pousser\n",
        "une plante portant plusieurs Baies.\r",
        "Plus tu en planteras et plus il y aura\n",
        "de Baies dans le monde.\r",
        "J’espère que tu nous aideras à planter\n",
        "des Baies partout!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FlowerShop_Text_PlantBerryInSoil",
      "en_US": [
        "Please plant that Berry in soft,\n",
        "earthy soil.\r",
        "If you come by again tomorrow,\n",
        "I’ll have a different Berry for you."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "S’il te plaît, plante cette Baie dans un\n",
        "sol meuble et fertile!\r",
        "Reviens demain, je te donnerai\n",
        "une Baie différente."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FlowerShop_Text_WaterBerriesUsingSprayduck",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer, please water Berries using\n",
        "this Sprayduck watering can.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "S’il te plaît, Dresseur, arrose les\n",
        "Baies avec ce Kwakarrosoir.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FlowerShop_Text_UseSprayduckToWaterSoil",
      "en_US": [
        "Use that Sprayduck to water the soil\n",
        "where you’ve planted Berries.\r",
        "You should also water Berry plants\n",
        "while they are growing."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Utilise ce Kwakarrosoir pour arroser le\n",
        "sol où tu as planté des Baies.\r",
        "Tu devrais aussi arroser les plants de\n",
        "Baie pendant leur croissance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FlowerShop_Text_Greet",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello!\r",
        "Would you like to exchange your\n",
        "Berries for some Accessories?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour!\r",
        "Ici nous échangeons vos Baies contre\n",
        "des Accessoires."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FlowerShop_Text_Thanks",
      "en_US": [
